{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04001.SBN#0027", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04001.SBN", "offset": 9830, "capacity": 32, "raw_hex": "f7d1f19cf944f1d4f2c0f7d12f2ff0b1f0e7f7d1f35ff0dbf9a9f0dff0f4f7d1", "baseline_text": "…내가 만든…//나를…배신한 제도…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "……我が作り……//我を……裏切りし都……", "pointer_offset": 9244, "unit": "dialogue:bf2365da5414d1c8", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04001.SBN#0028", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04001.SBN", "offset": 9871, "capacity": 17, "raw_hex": "657630343030315f7330335f312e6d626f", "baseline_text": "ev04001_s03_1.mbo", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ev04001_s03_1.mbo", "pointer_offset": 9248, "unit": "dialogue:cb65bd95089d4482", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04001.SBN#0029", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04001.SBN", "offset": 9889, "capacity": 60, "raw_hex": "f144f0a8f7d1f2d9f173f4b5f1daf0aff7d12f2ff174f7d1f45bf0e7f7d1f181f1e2f0a5f0a8f7d12f2ff0f6f1fcf0c8f7d1f15df15ff15af0a8f7d1", "baseline_text": "가라…증귀놈들아…//파…괴를…연주하라…//멸망을…춤추어라…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ゆけい……蒸鬼ども……//破……壊を……奏でよ……//滅び……を舞え……", "pointer_offset": 9252, "unit": "dialogue:0da67d2480e86d32", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04001.SBN#0030", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04001.SBN", "offset": 9958, "capacity": 12, "raw_hex": "5f706c61795f6d6f74696f6e", "baseline_text": "_play_motion", "kind": "ascr", "source": "_play_motion", "pointer_offset": 9256, "unit": "dialogue:85fb0cbb71b8816a", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04001.SBN#0031", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04001.SBN", "offset": 9971, "capacity": 32, "raw_hex": "f0b2f0dff7d1f473f8eff1b5f0cff7d12f2ff7d1f0a6f0a8f9d0f26cf1b281b8", "baseline_text": "이제…필요 없다…//…사라져 버려∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "もう……いらぬ……//……消え去れ！", "pointer_offset": 9260, "unit": "dialogue:724aa32fb2a19a99", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04001.SBN#0032", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04001.SBN", "offset": 11444, "capacity": 16, "raw_hex": "f0d8f27ef0f1f957fa81f1a9f0cf81b8", "baseline_text": "그렇게는 못 한다∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "そうはさせるか！", "pointer_offset": 9264, "unit": "dialogue:e30145aaf6c9fa0d", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
