{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04001.SBN#0040", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04001.SBN", "offset": 10094, "capacity": 16, "raw_hex": "657630343030315f6e6167322e676f32", "baseline_text": "ev04001_nag2.go2", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ev04001_nag2.go2", "pointer_offset": 9296, "unit": "dialogue:4c68024dff0450ac", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04001.SBN#0041", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04001.SBN", "offset": 10111, "capacity": 64, "raw_hex": "f0abf0baf0a6f7d1f0a4f17bf261f0a4f15781432f2ff2c0f2c0f9a9f0aff0a9f0b2f1f3f0a4f1d4f7d12f2ff3a3f3a7f0bcf167f8f1fa98f285f0b2f148f7d1", "baseline_text": "미카사…지금까지는，//든든한 아군이었지만…//침몰시키게 될 줄이야…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ミカサ……今までは、//心強い味方だったが……//沈めることになるとは……", "pointer_offset": 9300, "unit": "dialogue:6e379440ab306862", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04001.SBN#0042", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04001.SBN", "offset": 10182, "capacity": 9, "raw_hex": "484952415f4d4f4e49", "baseline_text": "HIRA_MONI", "kind": "ascr", "source": "HIRA_MONI", "pointer_offset": 9304, "unit": "dialogue:f3ef8ea4faf85bbb", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04001.SBN#0043", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04001.SBN", "offset": 11465, "capacity": 4, "raw_hex": "f0a4f26a", "baseline_text": "지상", "kind": "ascr", "source": "地", "pointer_offset": 9308, "unit": "dialogue:bdbd41e490e2e1d0", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04001.SBN#0044", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04001.SBN", "offset": 11470, "capacity": 4, "raw_hex": "f0a4f26a", "baseline_text": "지상", "kind": "ascr", "source": "地", "pointer_offset": 9312, "unit": "dialogue:bdbd41e490e2e1d0", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04001.SBN#0045", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04001.SBN", "offset": 10198, "capacity": 36, "raw_hex": "f2c9f2e9f15a81b82f2ff0a4f26af8f3f362f2a2f0f181b82f2ffa80f293f35cf14b81b8", "baseline_text": "알았어∈//지상은 맡길게∈//잘 부탁해∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "了解だ∈//地上はまかせた！//しっかりと頼むぞ∈", "pointer_offset": 9316, "unit": "dialogue:f4a4a4fe83ca6404", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04001.SBN#0046", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04001.SBN", "offset": 10245, "capacity": 9, "raw_hex": "544f4a495f4d4f4e49", "baseline_text": "TOJI_MONI", "kind": "ascr", "source": "TOJI_MONI", "pointer_offset": 9320, "unit": "dialogue:d83a5ca624f28b12", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04001.SBN#0047", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04001.SBN", "offset": 10255, "capacity": 2, "raw_hex": "f0af", "baseline_text": "아", "kind": "ascr", "source": "あ", "pointer_offset": 9324, "unit": "dialogue:dc5a4d3d82f7e157", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04001.SBN#0048", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04001.SBN", "offset": 10258, "capacity": 38, "raw_hex": "f3d3f0e4f7d1f0abf0baf0a6f8e1f1a3f164f0b22f2ff8b2f18ef0f4f9ccf285f0b2f148f7d1", "baseline_text": "젠장…미카사의 포격이//이 정도일 줄이야…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "くそっ……ミカサの砲撃が//これほどとは……", "pointer_offset": 9328, "unit": "dialogue:d9ff56a89bc53c73", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04001.SBN#0049", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04001.SBN", "offset": 10301, "capacity": 62, "raw_hex": "f7d1f0baf168f0a8f7d1f15df15ff0aef0b881442f2ff0dff0f4f8e7f0f6f0a5f14ff7d1f279f14bf7d12f2ff0baf168f0a8f7d1f15df15ff0aef0b8f7d1", "baseline_text": "…카구라…춤추리니．//제도를 멸하기…위해…//카구라…춤추리니…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "……神楽……舞うなり。//帝都を滅する……ため……//神楽……舞うなり……", "pointer_offset": 9332, "unit": "dialogue:d2d8eb418a4b9529", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04001.SBN#0050", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04001.SBN", "offset": 10372, "capacity": 58, "raw_hex": "f7d1f0ecf8f3f253f3e3f0d3f14481b82f2ff144f0fa8143f271f0f9f1da81b82f2ff1adf0aef8e1f0dff0f4f8e7f168f0a5f957f1c8f14881b8", "baseline_text": "…적은 저곳인가∈//가자，모두들∈//우리의 제도를 구하는 거야∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "……敵はあそこか！//いくぞ、みんな∈//俺たちの帝都を救うんだ！", "pointer_offset": 9336, "unit": "dialogue:4e89d75a6e04853e", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04001.SBN#0051", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04001.SBN", "offset": 11475, "capacity": 12, "raw_hex": "f2c9f29ef0cef0b8f0cf81b8", "baseline_text": "알겠습니다∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "了解∈", "pointer_offset": 9340, "unit": "dialogue:2d80dcf567869b6d", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
